#: ../../site/index.md:1
msgid "fincore_cpp"
msgstr "fincore_cpp"

#: ../../site/index.md:3
msgid ""
"`fincore_cpp` is a native C++23 library for portfolio, factor, performance "
"and risk analytics. It is a native implementation with its own typed API; it "
"does not promise Python object or pandas compatibility."
msgstr ""
"`fincore_cpp` 是一个原生 C++23 库，用于投资组合、因子、业绩与风险分析。它是具"
"有自身类型化 API 的原生实现，不承诺兼容 Python 对象或 pandas。"

#: ../../site/index.md:39
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../site/index.md:41
msgid ""
"The library consumes a local `DataFrame` type and returns owning typed "
"results. The documentation distinguishes the stable public surface from "
"internal `fincore::detail` helpers. Optional visualization and plotting "
"adapters are built only when their CMake options and dependencies are "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"该库使用本地 `DataFrame` 类型，并返回拥有所有权的类型化结果。文档区分了稳定的"
"公共接口与内部 `fincore::detail` 辅助实现。可选的可视化与绘图适配器仅在其 "
"CMake 选项和依赖启用时才会构建。"

#: ../../site/index.md:46
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../site/index.md:48
msgid ""
"This site is generated from the same source commit as the C++ library and "
"its English/Chinese guides. It is validated locally with strict Sphinx and "
"Doxygen checks; external hosting status is recorded separately in the "
"publication notes."
msgstr ""
"本站点与 C++ 库及其英文/中文指南由同一源提交生成。站点在本地通过严格的 "
"Sphinx 和 Doxygen 检查进行验证；外部托管状态另行记录在发布说明中。"
